---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Full-Time Care - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care program with flexible hours, extended care options, and comprehensive services for all ages.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/group_snack_time_healthy_eating_background.jpg" 
        alt="Full-time care" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Full-Time Care</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Comprehensive full-time childcare with flexible hours, extended care options, and services for all ages.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care program provides comprehensive childcare with flexible hours and extended care options. The Full-Time Care program at Marietta Childcare serves families who need reliable, quality care throughout the year.
        </p>

        <h2>Full-Time Enrollment</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care program includes year-round enrollment with consistent care and education. The Full-Time Care program provides stability and continuity for children's development and learning.
        </p>

        <h2>Flexible Hours</h2>
        <p>
          The Full-Time Care program at Marietta Childcare offers flexible hours to accommodate working parents' schedules. Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care operates from 6:30 AM to 6:30 PM, Monday through Friday.
        </p>

        <h2>Extended Care Options</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care program includes extended care options for families needing care beyond standard hours. The Full-Time Care program accommodates various work schedules and family needs.
        </p>

        <h2>Comprehensive Services</h2>
        <p>
          The Full-Time Care program at Marietta Childcare includes meals, snacks, educational programming, and enrichment activities. Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care provides all-inclusive services for families' convenience.
        </p>

        <h2>All Age Groups</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care program serves all age groups from infants through school-age children. The Full-Time Care program provides age-appropriate programming for each developmental stage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Full-Time Benefits</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Year-round care</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible hours</li>
            <li>✓ Extended care</li>
            <li>✓ All meals included</li>
            <li>✓ Educational programs</li>
            <li>✓ Enrichment activities</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Program Details</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Infants through school-age</li>
            <li>✓ 6:30 AM - 6:30 PM hours</li>
            <li>✓ Monday - Friday operation</li>
            <li>✓ Holiday closures only</li>
            <li>✓ Competitive pricing</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible payment options</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Comprehensive Full-Time Childcare</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare's Full-Time Care program provides everything your family needs. The Full-Time Care program offers reliable, quality care with educational programming and enrichment activities.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Enroll in Full-Time Care
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs & Resources</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs/part-time-care" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Part-Time Care Options →</a>
          <a href="/faq/how-much-childcare-cost" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Pricing Information →</a>
          <a href="/faq/hours-and-schedule" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Hours and Schedule →</a>
          <a href="/programs" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">All Programs →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
